(6906254, 1041107, 114225, '<td valign="top">After? This looks very much like pre-game stretching (their hair isn''t even sweaty yet).<br/> <br/>What I''m saying above is that a photo should fit with the headline in a factual way, and even if this is truly after the match, it doesn''t look like it.</td>', 'After? This looks very much like pre-game stretching (their hair isn''t even sweaty yet). What I''m saying above is that a photo should fit with the headline in a factual way, and even if this is truly after the match, it doesn''t look like it.', '2012-11-14 14:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
