(6908143, 1041223, 41337, '<td valign="top">As a color version (with more depth and detail retained) it would make for a great stock image but for this challenge it doesn''t really fit, IMO. This is not the type of photo that I could see any paper using with a story like that. You almost have to show people in the shot such as a crowd of people (as to indicate the risk) or a lab technician shown in a real world environment.</td>', 'As a color version (with more depth and detail retained) it would make for a great stock image but for this challenge it doesn''t really fit, IMO. This is not the type of photo that I could see any paper using with a story like that. You almost have to show people in the shot such as a crowd of people (as to indicate the risk) or a lab technician shown in a real world environment.', '2012-11-17 19:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6908147, 1041254, 41337, '<td valign="top">The tones really make this a pleasing image to look at. Can''t say the title helps you in this challenge anyway.</td>', 'The tones really make this a pleasing image to look at. Can''t say the title helps you in this challenge anyway.', '2012-11-17 19:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
