(6910249, 1041240, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Anitas Notes:</b></div><hr/><i>I really wasn''t going to enter this but I took this on a shoot for a playgroup the day before the challenge <b>started</b></i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''m sure you meant "ended" ;-) It''s a great shoeho- uh, I mean shot. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Anitas Notes:I really wasn''t going to enter this but I took this on a shoot for a playgroup the day before the challenge started I''m sure you meant "ended" ;-) It''s a great shoeho- uh, I mean shot. :)', '2012-11-21 01:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
