(6910257, 1041107, 28742, '<td valign="top">So, I may be reading the photo wrong, but it tells me that they all blame the guy on the ground for the loss and the one guy says "I''ll hold him down. You guys make sure nobody is watching and then beat him senseless with your sticks." ;-)</td>', 'So, I may be reading the photo wrong, but it tells me that they all blame the guy on the ground for the loss and the one guy says "I''ll hold him down. You guys make sure nobody is watching and then beat him senseless with your sticks." ;-)', '2012-11-21 01:24:02.000000', NULL, 0),
