(6910275, 1040820, 113591, '<td valign="top">I''m with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59029" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">snaffles</a> Tenseness everywhere. Thanks.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m with  snaffles Tenseness everywhere. Thanks. ', '2012-11-21 01:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6910277, 1041220, 67258, '<td valign="top">When I was voting I did wonder how much difference there was between what might be on a front page in different countries.  This is exactly the sort of photo that would appear in a British broadsheet on the day following Remembrance Sunday.  My only criticism, and hard to avoid, is that I find the top left hand corner distracting, but do accept that is a compromise you had to make in order to get the statue at the most interesting angle.  Hope you are enjoying your visit over here!<br/></td>', 'When I was voting I did wonder how much difference there was between what might be on a front page in different countries.  This is exactly the sort of photo that would appear in a British broadsheet on the day following Remembrance Sunday.  My only criticism, and hard to avoid, is that I find the top left hand corner distracting, but do accept that is a compromise you had to make in order to get the statue at the most interesting angle.  Hope you are enjoying your visit over here!', '2012-11-21 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
